+# Lore Contract
+
+The canonical universe bible is maintained at
+<https://github.com/majieddd/cosmic-conquest-lore>.
+
+The live game IDs remain stable:
+
+- `human` → Humanity / Solar Schism
+- `light` → Federation of Light / Luminous Accord
+- `xeno` → Extraction Compact / Severed Houses
+- `pirate` → Free Captains / Scrap Constellation
+- `robot` → The Parallel, a playable Continuance coalition
+
+The neutral Vigil is legacy Old Weather enforcement and is not the same polity
+as the playable Parallel. Lore changes must preserve save keys, balance, and the
+mechanical identities documented in the game repository.
+
+Research sources, evidence labels, and extended canon remain in the lore
+repository; the game should import only concise, player-facing summaries.
